{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/zi98nu94","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":423.99,"top":19.62,"width":855.98,"height":18.18},"name":"Text 0","text":"WHY THIS IS BUILDABLE","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":14.67,"typeface":"IBM Plex Sans SemiBold","color":"#0A7C78","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/87ipkzal","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":423.99,"top":51,"width":810.65,"height":96.1},"name":"Text 1","text":"Practical, incremental, and feasible for a student team","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":45.33,"typeface":"Sora Bold","color":"#10201D","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/98rqt4r6","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":423.99,"top":170.84,"width":389.32,"height":154.5},"name":"Text 2","text":"Customers: easier product discovery and a more convenient online shopping flow.\nRetail businesses: a path from physical stores to online sales.\nStore administrators: clearer inventory and order information.","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":18.67,"typeface":"IBM Plex Sans Bold","color":"#10201D","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ml07i9sv","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":845.31,"top":170.28,"width":389.32,"height":226},"name":"Text 3","text":"Uses established open-source technologies.\nAiven PostgreSQL, Kafka, and OpenSearch are provisioned; app links are unverified.\nCan be built incrementally by a small student team.\nCan be demonstrated with a limited catalogue and sample orders.","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":18.67,"typeface":"IBM Plex Sans","color":"#10201D","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/7m98ru9g","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":423.99,"top":420.94,"width":855.98,"height":19.35},"name":"Text 4","text":"Expected benefit: a foundation for adding services later without claiming production readiness.","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":14.67,"typeface":"IBM Plex Sans","color":"#5F6D68","alignment":"left"}}
